  "notes": "This is a per-NETWORK/per-autoroute average eur/km MODEL for a class-1 light car, NOT the exact gare-to-gare price matrix (which is not freely available as a single open file). Rates are calibrated from ASFA published per-network averages, per-concession tariff arretes, and several known full-route prices; concession->rate defaults are used where open per-autoroute data is thin (APRR ~0.085, AREA ~0.115, ASF ~0.097-0.116, Cofiroute ~0.092, Escota ~0.13, Sanef ~0.09, SAPN ~0.095 eur/km class 1, 2025-2026). Genuinely toll-free axes (A75 Clermont-Beziers excl. Millau viaduct, A20 Vierzon-Brive/Montauban, A35 Alsace, A31, A84 Normandie, urban A104/A411) are flagged tolled=false / eurPerKm=0. Short urban/free motorway sections are also netted out by a minimum-tollable-km clamp in the estimator. Typical accuracy vs the published gantry price is within ~15-25% on long inter-city trips; short and mixed-concession trips can deviate more. The Millau viaduct (A75) one-off toll is not modeled (it is a fixed structure toll, not eur/km)."
